# oracle: pair_style meam, two-element B2 (CsCl) alloy with nn2(1,2) = nn2(1,1) = nn2(2,2) = 1 (w38m2nn_lib.meam + w38m2nn_b2.meam, zbl 0, Cmin(1,1,1) = Cmin(2,2,2) = 0.7), non-periodic clusters: A-B dimers at 2.6 A, 2.2 A, 2.4 A, a B-A-B chain with bonds 3.0 and 3.3 A 
# oracle: the reference of the B2 pair includes the second shell (like neighbours) through the pair terms of the elements; the cluster energies are native values (black box)
# oracle-inputs: w38m2nn_lib.meam w38m2nn_b2.meam
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-9 abs=1e-12
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
boundary        f f f
region          box block -40 40 -40 40 -40 40
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 single 0 0 0 units box
create_atoms    2 single 2.6 0 0 units box
create_atoms    2 single 20 0 0 units box
create_atoms    1 single 22.2 0 0 units box
create_atoms    1 single 0 20 0 units box
create_atoms    2 single 0 22.4 0 units box
create_atoms    2 single 36 0 0 units box
create_atoms    1 single 36 3.0 0 units box
create_atoms    2 single 36 6.3 0 units box
mass            1 63.546
mass            2 58.69
velocity        all set 0.0 0.0 0.0 units box
pair_style      meam
pair_coeff      * * w38m2nn_lib.meam A B w38m2nn_b2.meam A B
timestep        0.001
fix             1 all nve
thermo          10
thermo_style    custom step pe press
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
run             0
